        ],
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Khao Sok Discovery Package",
        "main_title": "Package Stays",
        "author": "https://www.facebook.com/ourjunglecamp/",
        "language": "en",
        "level": 2,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Overnight on Cheow Lan Lake",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "3 Days / 2 Nights Perfect balance between jungle and lake. First night in a treehouse and second one in a floating rafthouse. This is our most popular package when traveling through Thailand for a limited time.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": [
          {
            "text": "3 Days / 2 Nights",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Khao Sok Experience Package",
        "main_title": "Package Stays",
        "author": "https://www.facebook.com/ourjunglecamp/",
        "language": "en",
        "level": 2,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Full day on Cheow Lan Lake",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "3 Days / 2 Nights\nWhen sleeping in a treehouse or bungalow is your childhood dream!\nStay two nights in a wooden treehouse or bungalow and still enjoy a full day on Cheow Lan Lake. Explore Khao Sok's wonders with river adventures and night safari.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": [
          {
            "text": "4 Days / 3 Nights",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Khao Sok Adventure Package",
        "main_title": "Package Stays",
        "author": "https://www.facebook.com/ourjunglecamp/",
        "language": "en",
        "level": 2,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Overnight on Chew Lan lake and 2 Night Jungle Adventure",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "4 Days / 3 Nights\nTake your time to savor all that Khao Sok has to offer: hike through the jungle, explore caves, raft along the rivers, and learn to cook in bamboo. Enjoy the first two nights at our resort and the third in a floating rafthouse on the famous Cheow Lan Lake. Perfect for adventurous nature lovers and families, this package promises excitement at every turn!",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": [
          {
            "text": "4 days / 3 nights",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Khao Sok Family Package",
        "main_title": "Package Stays",
        "author": "https://www.facebook.com/ourjunglecamp/",
        "language": "en",
        "level": 2,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Full Day on Chew Lan Lake and Kids Activities",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "4 Days / 3 Nights\nThis package is perfect for nature-loving families who want to make long lasting memories. Three nights at the resort, one day lake tour. You and your kids will engage in hands-on activities, learning about the beauty of nature and even bathing with Elephants! With this package you will also actively support our Non Profit: Jungle Life Camp and promote environmental awareness and sustainability.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Khao Sok Family Package",
        "main_title": "Package Stays",
        "author": "https://www.facebook.com/ourjunglecamp/",
        "language": "en",
        "level": 2,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Incredible views. Diverse wildlife. Amazing food. Simple & Unique accommodation with charm.",
