        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "About Us",
        "main_title": "Package Stays",
        "author": "https://www.facebook.com/ourjunglecamp/",
        "language": "en",
        "level": 2,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Our Jungle Camp will connect you to it´s awesome natural surroundings in an atmosphere of comfort and relaxation.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Khao Sok´s unique Nature Resort, with Treehouse and Bungalow accommodation options for families and individual travellers alike.\nNestled between Khao Sok Rainforest and the gentle flowing Sok River, Our Jungle Camp boasts Double and Single-Storey Treehouses as well as unique Adobe and Nature Bungalows. All our accommodation option, have been meticulously crafted from natural materials, creating a fully inclusive experience of the awe-inspiring natural surrounds, while offering incredible views of the river, cliffs and diverse wildlife.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Join us at Our Jungle Camp in Khao Sok for \"Exquisite Simplicity, Rustic Chic and Jungle Boutique - Connect with amidst the pristine environment of Khao Sok National Park\"",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Prefer air-conditioned comfort while staying close to nature? Our sister property, Lost Horizon Resort, offers spacious air-conditioned villas in a peaceful rainforest setting.",
            "url": "https://losthorizonkhaosok.com/",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://losthorizonkhaosok.com/",
                "anchor_text": "Lost Horizon Resort"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Book your Khao Sok Accommodation now",
            "url": "https://www.khaosokecoresort.com/booking/",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.khaosokecoresort.com/booking/",
                "anchor_text": "Book your Khao Sok Accommodation now"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Restaurant & Bar",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Fine\nDining &\nDrinking",
        "main_title": "Package Stays",
        "author": "https://www.facebook.com/ourjunglecamp/",
        "language": "en",
        "level": 2,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Dinning at our restaurant means connecting with the Earth. Our chefs and on-site organic farm work side-by-side to harvest nature’s bounty bringing nourishment and pleasure to every plate with handed down family recipes. Enjoy the sharing of meals among families and friends – simple and extraordinary. Our Jungle Camp's bar offers flavour and mood with cocktails and drinks to suit all palates, lounge in comfort and listen to the sounds of the jungle's nightly symphony.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Classic\nStyle &\nComfort",
        "main_title": "Package Stays",
        "author": "https://www.facebook.com/ourjunglecamp/",
        "language": "en",
        "level": 2,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Nestled in Khao Sok National Park along a secluded part of the river, here, among a jungle older and more diverse than the Amazon our intimate community of Treehouses, Bungalows, Earth Houses(Adobe) and Bamboo Huts allow you to connect with nature. We have rooms for all budgets, each cabin has been meticulously crafted with all the necessities that you will need to relax and unwind in your surrounds.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Tour Desk",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Tours\nTrips &\nActivity",
        "main_title": "Package Stays",
        "author": "https://www.facebook.com/ourjunglecamp/",
        "language": "en",
        "level": 2,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Our Jungle Camp offers a world of options to help you shape your experience here in Khao Sok National Park and make your time a memorable one. Our Front desk can recommend and arrange all activities and tours Khao Sok has to offer from Overnight Lake experiences on Cheow Lan Lake, Elephant bathing, immersive nature hikes (day or night), river tubing and even a cooking class where you pick the vegetables from our on-site organic farm.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Family Friendly",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Fun For\nKids &\nParents",
        "main_title": "Package Stays",
        "author": "https://www.facebook.com/ourjunglecamp/",
        "language": "en",
        "level": 2,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "We offer a range of family friendly activities including a medley enriching activities for the kids, so they can engage and connect with nature in entertaining and memorable ways.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Special Events",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Groups\nRetreats\n& Events",
        "main_title": "Package Stays",
        "author": "https://www.facebook.com/ourjunglecamp/",
        "language": "en",
        "level": 2,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Our Jungle Camp’s circular open air clubhouse is perfect for events, retreats and groups. Framed by the river and limestone cliffs it offers an unforgettable photogenic venue for people to come together in memorable ways and connect with nature.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Unforgettable Khao Sok",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Making A Difference",
        "main_title": "Package Stays",
        "author": "https://www.facebook.com/ourjunglecamp/",
        "language": "en",
        "level": 2,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Nestled in the Khao Sok rainforest and built from bamboo and renewable materials, our treehouses and bungalows are sure to leave you inspired.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Our Jungle Camp and our sister resort, Our Jungle House, have been pioneering nature tourism with meticulously crafted experiences since 1975.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "By visiting the resort you are subsidizing an on-site nature camp for Thai children from all walks of life to experience and learn about nature.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Our Jungle Camp sits nestled in the Khao Sok rainforest and is built from bamboo and renewable materials. Our Jungle Camp and our sister resort Our Jungle House have been pioneering nature tourism with meticulously crafted experiences since 1975.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": [
          {
